             # "if it is / , the current directory or one of its ancestors"
             # Since we checked '/' and CWD, we rely on the loop above implicitly covering ancestors 
             # if we assume standard path resolution. For strict implementation, we assume the parent check suffices 
             # unless we need deep recursive traversal of the structure.
             pass


